# Bestow Greatness on the caster's own attacker (CR 611.2a, 702.19b): Bot1's Llanowar Elves attack on turn 3 and Bot2's Birds of
# Paradise (0/1) block. After blockers Bot1 casts Bestow Greatness on the Elves, a 5/5 trampler: one damage is assigned to the
# Birds and the other four trample over to Bot2 (20 to 16), where a plain 1/1 Elves would have dealt its one damage to the Birds
# and none to the player. The Birds die.

